    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>New Game!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301190/extras/b104caa551e50700723378bcecf16179.avif?t=1708076573\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Along came a mule\u2026</h2><br><br>You'd better run, because Mr. Willickers is close behind. The last of his decaying taste-buds seek the flesh and bone of your first born son.<br><br>A paramilitary band of fighters is on your side, but even their selfless sacrifice will only serve to deter the creature. <br><br>Your car is dead. Your body is waning. Your son\u2019s fever is growing worse.<br><br>Can you hold out until rescue comes?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight an Insurmountable Enemy</h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3 different weapons to find. Pistol, Shotgun, and Rifle.<br></li><li>Explore an old town abandoned to the elements.<br></li><li>Fend off a tireless beast that cannot be killed.<br></li><li>Use firearms to keep Mr. Willickers at bay in a perilous game of momentum.<br></li><li>Use Emergency Flares to summon support: Infantry, Trucks, Tanks, Tactical Missiles, and Snipers. <br></li><li>Maintain your stamina levels with snacks or by resting.<br></li><li>Mr. Willickers can perform miracles, both wonderful and profane. He can even Raise the Dead to aid him.<br></li><li>Survive until your rescue helicopter arrives.</li></ul><br>Escaping with your son alive will be an almost impossible task. Only a worthy few will succeed.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301190/extras/b104caa551e50700723378bcecf16179.avif?t=1708076573\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Along came a mule\u2026</h2><br><br>You'd better run, because Mr. Willickers is close behind. The last of his decaying taste-buds seek the flesh and bone of your first born son.<br><br>A paramilitary band of fighters is on your side, but even their selfless sacrifice will only serve to deter the creature. <br><br>Your car is dead. Your body is waning. Your son\u2019s fever is growing worse.<br><br>Can you hold out until rescue comes?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight an Insurmountable Enemy</h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3 different weapons to find. Pistol, Shotgun, and Rifle.<br></li><li>Explore an old town abandoned to the elements.<br></li><li>Fend off a tireless beast that cannot be killed.<br></li><li>Use firearms to keep Mr. Willickers at bay in a perilous game of momentum.<br></li><li>Use Emergency Flares to summon support: Infantry, Trucks, Tanks, Tactical Missiles, and Snipers. <br></li><li>Maintain your stamina levels with snacks or by resting.<br></li><li>Mr. Willickers can perform miracles, both wonderful and profane. He can even Raise the Dead to aid him.<br></li><li>Survive until your rescue helicopter arrives.</li></ul><br>Escaping with your son alive will be an almost impossible task. Only a worthy few will succeed.",
    "short_description": "Mr. Willickers can never, ever die. He'll chase you until the very ends of the earth.",
